WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:02.002
- I think in general

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.938
the government is not
good at what it does.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:08.608
It's either incompetent or
ineffective or inefficient,

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.577
or it's kind of villainous.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:11.878
One of the reasons you had asked

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.346
how did I become a libertarian,

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.815
and part of it is after
I graduated college,

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.918 align:start size:97% position:3%
and before I got into the
lucrative teen mag business,

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.387
(laughing)

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:22.255
I wrote for a bunch of
newspapers in New Jersey,

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:23.757
I was a reporter

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.658
and I would always have to go
to planning board meetings.

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.228
And like, if you wanna turn
people into libertarians,

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.563
like just busload school kids,

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:34.200
bus school kids to planning
board meetings where people,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.070
just the people in charge
just rail against anybody

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.106
who had the temerity to
like improve their land

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
or their house without
getting the right permits,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start position:0%
and half the cases I saw, people
didn't even know like, oh,

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:49.749
I needed to go to the city
council to put up a fence

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.085
or like to make my house better.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.153
It's like, screw you.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:56.356
(upbeat ambient music)

